    "https://jobs.monmouth.edu/MON1000MON/JobBoard/d4da5ea7-24db-4f02-a484-7497ffffb76d/OpportunityDetail?opportunityId=fcc3ce41-75fa-4642-9622-e41b3c76965f": {
      "title": "My Job Search",
      "description": "My Job Search Skip to main content Accessibility Note: If you are a job seeker with a disability and require a reasonable accommodation to apply for one of our jobs, you will find the contact information to request the appropriate accommodation by visiting the following page: Accessibility Accommodation for Applicants Dismiss Note Toggle Navigation Find Opportunities U.S. English British English CA English Danish Deutsch Dutch Español FR French Français Canadien Italian Português do Brasil Swedish U.S. English 简体中文 Sign In Monmouth University Tips & Tricks × Tips & Tricks Search modifier Either terms word1 word2 Manager Supervisor retrieves an opportunity for a Manager or a Supervisor when searching for an opportunity. Exact phrase \"word1 word2\" \"Customer Service Manager\"\"Customer Service Supervisor\" retrieves an opportunity for a Customer Service Manager or a Customer Service Supervisor. Include terms word1 + word2 Manager + Accounting returns opportunities for Manager and Accounting. Exclude terms -word1 -Sales returns all opportunities that do not have the term Sales associated to them. Either OR word1 | word2 Developer + (apache | weblogic | websphere) returns Developer opportunities with at least one of the 3 relevant terms. Combining terms word1 + -word2 Manager + -Sales returns all opportunities that have Manager in them that do NOT have Sales associated to them. Tips & Tricks Search modifier Description Example Either terms word1 word2 Either search term value. Manager Supervisor retrieves an opportunity for a Manager or a Supervisor when searching for an opportunity. Exact phrase \"word1 word2\" Returns the exact phrase match within quotes. \"Customer Service Manager\"\"Customer Service Supervisor\" retrieves an opportunity for a Customer Service Manager or a Customer Service Supervisor. Include terms word1 + word2 The '+' indicates that both terms must be present. Manager + Accounting returns opportunities for Manager and Accounting. Exclude terms -word1 The '-' indicates that the term must not be present. -Sales returns all opportunities that do not have the term Sales associated to them. Either OR word1 | word2 Offers flexible inclusion, and typically broadens your search results.You may use parentheses to encapsulate OR statements. Developer + (apache | weblogic | websphere) returns Developer opportunities with at least one of the 3 relevant terms. Combining terms word1 + -word2 Retrieves records that include the first term if they do not have the second term. Manager + -Sales returns all opportunities that have Manager in them that do NOT have Sales associated to them. Filter by Company Location No Results Found The maximum number of filters has been reached. View Locations Filter by Job Category No Results Found The maximum number of filters has been reached. View Job Categories Filter by Schedule The maximum number of filters has been reached. No Results Found Filter by Job Location Type The maximum number of filters has been reached. No Results Found Reset Activate job alerts for this search Activate job alerts for this search Showing 50 of 75 opportunities Sort By Newest By Newest By Oldest Library Technician (Part-Time) Sep 14, 2026 Job Category : Library Administration Requisition Number : LIBRA001390 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for two part-time Library Technicians in the Monmouth University Guggenheim Memorial Library.  There are two shifts available:\n\nShift 1 - 7:45 am to 12:45 pm - Monday through Thursday\n\nShift 2 - 7:45 am -1:15 pm Friday, 8:45 am-5 pm Saturday, 12:45 pm -9:00 pm Sunday On-Call Laboratory Animal & Vivarium Technician Sep 14, 2026 Job Category : Temporary or On-Call Requisition Number : ONCAL001389 Sched