nmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for Director of Research Compliance. Clinical Counselor (Temporary) Aug 17, 2026 Job Category : Health Services/Counseling Requisition Number : CLINI001377 Schedule : Full Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for a Clinical Counselor (Temporary) to work in the Counseling and Prevention Services Department for students.  This is a temporary, full-time, non-benefits eligible position anticipated from mid-September, 2026 through May, 2027. Staff Accountant Jul 30, 2026 Job Category : Finance/Budgets/Accounting Requisition Number : STAFF001374 Schedule : Full Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for a Staff Account. The role of of the Staff Accountant resides in the Accounting Department of the Controller’s Office. The Controller’s Office team is comprised of accounting and finance professionals who are responsible for the general accounting, treasury management, financial and tax reporting and compliance for both the University and the Bruce Springsteen Archives and Center for American Music, a nonprofit tax-exempt corporation and supporting organization of Monmouth University. Adjunct, Public Historian Jul 28, 2026 Job Category : Adjunct Requisition Number : ADJUN001378 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07