outh University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking qualified candidates for an Adjunct Professor of Data Science in the Computer Science and Software Engineering department. The successful candidate will teach undergraduate and/or graduate-level courses in Data Science. Adjunct, Nursing Lab Apr 28, 2026 Job Category : Adjunct Requisition Number : ADJUN001321 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University’s Marjorie K. Unterberg School of Nursing seeks Adjuncts for the Nursing Lab.  We hired both BSN and MSN prepared RN's with a minimum of one year of current clinical experience. The Nursing Lab promotes student learning about specific clinical tasks through visual and kinesthetic modalities. Instructors with an MSN not only teach the task but also the rationale behind the task and emphasize safety points. Instructors with a BSN reinforce previous learning. Adjunct, Professional Counseling Apr 23, 2026 Job Category : Adjunct Requisition Number : ADJUN001326 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site Monmouth Graduate Center 185 State Route 36 West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA Monmouth Graduate Center 185 State Route 36 West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for an Adjunct Professor of Professional Counseling. Police Officer Mar 27, 2026 Job Category : Police Requisition Number : PATRO001314 Schedule : Full Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University Police