, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for Director of Research Compliance. Staff Accountant Jul 30, 2026 Job Category : Finance/Budgets/Accounting Requisition Number : STAFF001374 Schedule : Full Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for a Staff Account. The role of of the Staff Accountant resides in the Accounting Department of the Controller’s Office. The Controller’s Office team is comprised of accounting and finance professionals who are responsible for the general accounting, treasury management, financial and tax reporting and compliance for both the University and the Bruce Springsteen Archives and Center for American Music, a nonprofit tax-exempt corporation and supporting organization of Monmouth University. Adjunct, Public Historian Jul 28, 2026 Job Category : Adjunct Requisition Number : ADJUN001378 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less Monmouth University is seeking applications for Adjunct Professors of Public History in the History and Anthropology department. Clinical Faculty Supervisor Jun 30, 2026 Job Category : Adjunct Requisition Number : CLINI001342 Schedule : Part Time Job Location Type : On-site NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA NEW JERSEY Monmouth University Main Campus 400 Cedar Ave West Long Branch, NJ 07764, USA +0 more less The School of Education at Monmouth University is seeking applications for Clinical Faculty Supervisor. \n \nThe candidate would